 "brick_colour_profile": "Alternating long/short ends give two-course periods of 18.83 pixels on the west pier and 15.55–15.83 on the east in the 950×620 west view. The September 2017 west pier has a 10.73 px period and the 2015 east-station view of the east pier 13.39 px. Dividing by the local vertical projection gives about 0.061 m per course. On the signed west post the toothed facing stops above the pavement; on the east post it descends to the pavement.",
